  "instruction": "Mireille cannot run month-end close until the tax-rounding fix is validated with their finance lead, and she can pair on Wednesday or Thursday this week. Work out how much engineer time the session needs, which billing-qualified engineers genuinely have a free block in that window once on-call, leave, and existing bookings are respected, and whether anything earlier would be possible and on whose authority. Book the session on the block the evidence supports and leave Elodie a note with the day, what constrained it, and what the other routes would have required.",
